<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<p>
    This application displays a curated list of public tweets sourced from X (formerly Twitter).
    The goal is to surface meaningful conversations that are worth engaging with.
</p>

<h3>Data Usage</h3>
<ul>
    <li>This app only reads publicly available tweets.</li>
    <li>No personal data is collected, stored, or tracked.</li>
    <li>No login or authentication is required.</li>
    <li>No analytics, cookies, or third-party trackers are used.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Curation</h3>
<p>
    The tweets shown here are curated based on predefined interests and engagement signals.
